      "text": "PK id (uuid)\n   user_id (uuid, nullable)\n   status ('PENDING'|'PROCESSING'|'COMPLETED'|'MANUAL_REVIEW')\n   status_token_hash (text), attempt_count (int)\n   retry_after, locked_until (timestamptz)\n   data_completed_at, storage_completed_at (timestamptz)\n   email_attempted_at, email_sent_at (timestamptz)\n   last_error_code (text)",
